  Origin:    The grammar is authored in this repository, derived from the core
             syntax of Oracle's apexlang.ebnf (https://github.com/oracle/skills,
             commit 014cdb29f12dfa6a689bbe8a80ee1c5f0bf15be1). The fixtures are
             unmodified files from Oracle's example applications in the same
             repository and commit (listed in the fixture MANIFEST.tsv).
  License:   Universal Permissive License (UPL), Version 1.0
             Copyright (c) 2025 Oracle and/or its affiliates.
             The license text ships with each directory (LICENSE, LICENSE-UPL).
  The full pinned APEXlang corpus (oracle/apex, oracle/skills; UPL-1.0) is not
  vendored: oracle/apexlang/corpus.tsv lists it and
  scripts/apexlang-corpus.py fetches and verifies it.
